{"meta":{"commit":"b2d04e166","date":"2026-11-09","file":"config_lados_eject_strict_other_type.jsonl","machine":"enrichment_chamber","scenario":"The tile is saved, eject0 (ENERGY) is set to 1 and eject3 (ITEM) to 0 in component_config, and the tile is read back by BlockEntity.loadStatic and attached to the world: ejecting only for ENERGY, OUTPUT on the right. At tick 40 the item ejecting is turned on (positive control). The output slot is refilled to 64 clay balls every 20 ticks.","fields":"t: ticks after the first tick the scenario ran (the actions of tick t run in ServerTickEvent.Pre, the line is written in ServerTickEvent.Post, after the machine ticked); marks: the actions of the tick; facing; chests {world face: {item: count}}: what each of the 6 chests touching the machine holds (omitted faces are empty); output, input (and infusion, tank for the infuser): [item, count] of the slots, '' when empty; tick_delay: TileComponentEjector.tickDelay read by reflection; ejecting {type: bool}; config: the ITEM sides (front,left,right,back,top,bottom).","notes":["eject0 (energia) em 1 e eject3 (itens) em 0 no NBT, lido por BlockEntity.loadStatic e posto no mundo: ejecting de energia verdadeiro, de itens falso. Nada sai (energia nunca é DataType de saída da câmara; os itens estão desligados) e tickDelay fica em 0. No tick 40 os itens são ligados (controle positivo) e a saída parte para o baú da direita."]}}
